Description of Project
This project was created to explore the effetcs of internet adoption on a countries happiness. While we wanted to observe the direct effects of internet adoption on happiness we also wanted to analyze the
connection between internet adoption and GDP and avgerage country wages to uncover connections indireclty as well. The data was sourced from two kaggle datasets "Internet Prices Datasets for Analysis" and
"World Happiness Report". The data was joined in pgadmin4 using postgreSQL by country name and aggregated to show changes over the years from 2015-2019. 

Techniques used to analye the data include..
Linear Regression
Exponential Regression
Kmeans clustering
Correlation

Analysis findings can be found in the summary section of the Python Notebook. 
